tags: modify-resources, modify_resources_mu

A rate of the node: the price of one call of ModifyServiceSystemResources that the node does.

The value is MU for one. Example: 1000. The node takes it from the balance that
pays for the action.

The rate has no scope. A reader that does not know the rate ignores it.

=== formal
base=one
class=rate
name=modify-resources
of=one ModifyServiceSystemResources request that the node accepts, charged to the instance that changes
scope=none
